# Investor demo build (demo/static branch): frontend + static data only.
# Vercel auto-detects any api/*.py file as a serverless Function regardless
# of vercel.json's rewrites, so excluding these directories entirely is the
# only reliable way to guarantee no backend ships with this deploy.
# Leading slash anchors these to the repo root — without it, "api/" would
# also match src/api/ (the frontend's own API-provider code) and break the
# build (this bit us once already: "Cannot find module '@/api'").
/api/
/server/
